            "ChatGPT SEO: The New Way To Get Ready-To-Buy Traffic"
          ]
        ],
        "description": [
          [
            "Our research proves that ChatGPT traffic isn’t just real, it’s 4.4x more valuable than Google traffic. Businesses that understand how to show up in AI search are already seeing higher engagement, longer visits, and more revenue compared to traditional SEO.\n\nIn this video, I’ll break down my 3-Step ChatGPT Traffic System so you can turn AI search into one of your most powerful referral partners:\n\nChapters\n00:00 – Intro: Why ChatGPT Could Be Bigger Than Google\n0:40 – The Google vs ChatGPT Paradigm Shift\n03:17 – The 4 ChatGPT Visibility Factors\n05:25 – Case Study: How HubSpot Engineered AI Traffic\n07:51 – The 3-Step ChatGPT Traffic System\n10:15 – Why AI Search Is the New SEO\n\nInside, you’ll discover:\n\n- Why ChatGPT recommendations convert better than Google clicks\n- The 4 visibility factors that decide whether AI recommends your business\n- A real-world HubSpot case study you can copy today\n- My proven 3-step system to get AI’s attention, build buzz, and own your space\n\nIf you’ve ever felt like you missed the boat on SEO, this is your chance to get ahead of the curve."
          ]
        ]
      },
